 "pages": "p.5-6 (pins), p.8 (ROC), p.14-16 (timing), p.42/45 (Tables 13/15), p.64 (data format), p.65-68 (commands), p.69-71 (reading data), p.72-82 (registers)",
 "notModeled": [
  "analog input, PGA, reference, reference buffers and monitors, IDACs, VBIAS, low-side switch, system monitors (SYS_MON), global chop and offset/gain calibration math (registers stored only)",
  "STATUS flags other than FL_POR are never set; FL_POR stays 1 until written 0 (modeled as a plain R/W bit)",
  "optional STATUS byte before and CRC byte after the conversion data (SYS.SENDSTAT, SYS.CRC): the model always outputs the 24 data bits only",
  "the data field repeats with continued SCLKs (idle 'repeat'); RDATA/RREG sent mid-read abort the data read",
  "calibration commands SYOCAL, SYGCAL, SFOCAL (nop; OFCAL/FSCAL are not updated)",
  "conversion times are the first-data times of Table 13 (low-latency) and Table 15 (sinc3) without the programmable DELAY (default 14 tMOD = 54.7 us) and at fCLK = 4.096 MHz; later continuous conversions are 1 / data rate; global chop (Table 18-19) not modeled; the CLK pin is not used",
  "WREG to INPMUX, PGA, DATARATE, REF, IDACMAG, IDACMUX, SYS restarting a conversion in progress",
  "the START command is ignored while START/SYNC is high; STOP lets the current conversion finish; START/SYNC rising edge restarts a conversion in progress (sync)",
  "commands blocked during an RREG/WREG/RDATA until it completes; RREG past the last register outputs zeros; WREG past it is ignored",
  "DRDY returns high on the first SCLK falling edge (any command), and pulses high for tw(DRH) = 24 tCLK when the data were not read; only RREG, RDATA and WAKEUP work in power-down",
  "GPIO pins (GPIODAT/GPIOCON stored only; the shared analog/GPIO pins are never driven or read)",
  "RESET hold td(RSSC) = 4096 tCLK before SPI; SPI timeout (SYS.TIMEOUT)",
  "ID RESERVED bits [7:3] (xxh) modeled 0"
 ],
 "variants": "ADS124S06 (6 inputs + AINCOM; pins 19-22, 31, 32 lack the AIN6-AIN11 functions) and ADS124S08 (12 inputs) share ads124s06.pdf and the pinout; DEV_ID differs; own spec files",
